y  : Change abundances; if yes one will be asked for a new file
MV52ShockInputs/shockgrid.txt
N  : Change abundances; if yes one will be asked for a new file
N  : Change Abundance Offsets, if yes one will be asked for a ne file
N  : Use dust calculations.  Always no for shocks.
S5 : It's a shock calculation
D  : Ionization balance, D for default, C for calculate.  If yes get addtional question
X  : Ionization sources
V  : Shock jump parameter (V or T)
B  : Magetic filed parameter type
10 : Magnetic field at shock front
1e3 10.0 100.0  :  preshock T, H den, and shock velocity
F  : Diffuse field option
A  : Ending
3  : No of iterations
x0100_ : Output prefix
A  : Output settings
X   : No more outputs
A  : Runtime screen display
v100km/s KL low Te ending and 10micro Gauss fixed at shock front
E   : Start a new model

